  "title": "Development Procedures Manual | Castle Rock, CO - Official Website",
  "text": "Development Procedures Manual | Castle Rock, CO - Official Website\nSkip to Main Content\nTown Government\nDoing Business\nDiscover Castle Rock\nTown Topics\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nHome\nTown Government\nCode Central\nDevelopment Procedures Manual\nDevelopment Procedures Manual\nThe Development Procedures Manual outlines the steps and processes to be followed at each stage of the development process including planning, plan review and permitting. The manual works in conjunction with Titles 15, 16 and 17 of the municipal code.\nFlow chart\nView\ndevelopment process flow chart (PDF)\n.\nDevelopment Procedures Manual\nThe chapter-by-chapter listing of the below Development Procedures Manual is user-friendly and interactive. Several links to resources and information are included. References to the Town's Municipal Codes are outlined in red and other links are outlined in blue. You will need the latest version of Adobe Acrobat Reader installed on your computer to view the links. Receive a free\nAdobe Reader download\n.\nTable of Contents:\nChapter I - Overview (PDF)\nChapter II - Notice (PDF)\nChapter III - Early Project Feedback (PDF)\nChapter IV - Annexation/Zoning (PDF)\nChapter V - Site Development Plan (PDF)\nChapter VI - Variances (PDF)\nChapter VII - Historic Preservation (PDF)\nChapter VIII - Plats/Easements/Right-of-Way (PDF)\nChapter IX - Site Grading/Construction (PDF)\nChapter X - Permits (PDF)\nView the entire\nDevelopment Procedures Manual (PDF)\n.\nIf you are unable to access any portion of these documents due to a disability as defined under\nColorado House Bill 21-1110\n, we are here to help! Please call us at 303-663-4440,\nemail the Town’s accessibility team\nor\nsubmit an accommodation request form\n.\nQuestions\nIf you have questions you can\nemail the Planning Division\nor call 303-660-1393.\nDevelopment Procedures Manual\nInfrastructure Design Codes\nLand Development Applications and Checklists\nMunicipal Code\nPermit Application\nPublic Works Details and Forms\nAccess Online Services\nApply for Jobs\nAttend an Event\nPay Water Bill\nTrack Roadwork\nView Development Activity\nContact Us\n100 N. Wilcox St.\nCastle Rock, CO 80104\nPhone:\n720-896-8696\nTown staff directory\nTown news sign up\nConnect With Us\nFacebook\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nNextdoor\nX\nYouTube\nHelpful Links\nAccess online services\nFact or Fiction?\nFrequently asked questions\nLocal business directory\nTown amenities\nAdmin login\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHome\nParks & Rec\nWater\nPolice\nFire\nPublic Works\nDevelopment\nAccessibility\nCopyright\nNondiscrimination\nPrivacy\nSite Map\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by\nCivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nArrow Left\nArrow Right\n[]\nSlideshow Left Arrow\nSlideshow Right Arrow",
